    title: 'Working Professionals',
    body: 'For stagnation, AI pressure, skill under-leverage, career pivots, and a clearer route toward achieving earlier financial freedom through stronger skill stacking. If you feel under-leveraged, we help you build strategic upskilling plans for better compensation, stronger positioning, and multiple income streams.',
    groups: [
      {
        title: 'This is for you if',
        items: [
          "You're ready to upskill toward stronger compensation and high-value opportunities.",
